(NULL, 21, 51, 71, (SELECT id FROM ayat WHERE surah_id = 21 AND ayah_number = 51), (SELECT id FROM ayat WHERE surah_id = 21 AND ayah_number = 71), '21:51', '21:71', 21, 'Ibrahim questioned the idol worshiping of his father and his people and Ibrahim broke all their idols to show, that the gods who can not even defend themselves, how they can be of any benefit to them and They decided to burn him alive but Allah commanded the fire to be cool and comfortable for Ibrahim', 'Ibrahim mempersoalkan penyembahan berhala bapanya dan kaumnya, memecahkan semua berhala untuk menunjukkan bahawa berhala tidak mampu mempertahankan diri. Mereka mahu membakarnya, tetapi Allah memerintahkan api menjadi sejuk dan selesa bagi Ibrahim.', ARRAY['Ibrahim', 'Allah'], 62),
